    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2682" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>N.</u>
			9.18
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Ion</u>
			421
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶσα</span>):—poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>auspicious, opportune</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοιπόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.376
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				104
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ. ἐν φιλότητι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2068.9
				</span></i>
			:—freq. of omens, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσία ὄρνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
				</span></i>
			 l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.4.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mith.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Syr.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					410
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Timae.
				114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>meet, right</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴσιος
